message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Spectre: NINE EYES — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  BOND film package for Spectre (2015), mission codename NINE EYES. Six pure,
  deterministic analysis modules over one canonical dataset:
  surveillance-network data-flow centralization and betweenness; criminal-org
  cell structure, hierarchy and compartmentalization; connectivity geometry,
  articulation points and critical nodes; volume-weighted traffic interception
  and budgeted submodular monitoring allocation; compromise cascades through
  the brotherhood; and sensor-placement set cover with coverage redundancy.
authors:
